#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:5
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "椭圆"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:8
msgid "Create ellipse"
msgstr "创建椭圆"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:12
msgid ""
"To draw more easily, the folio grid can be displayed from **Display > "
"Display the grid** or from `toolbar`_ icon |grid|."
msgstr ""
"为了更方便地绘制，folio网格可以从 **Display > 显示网格** 或 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 图标 |grid| 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:20
msgid "grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:14
msgid "The ellipse can only be added to the `workspace`_ by `toolbar`_."
msgstr "椭圆只能由 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 添加到 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:16
msgid "Select the icon |ellipse| from the `toolbar`_ to add an ellipse."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |ellipse| 以添加椭圆 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:21
msgid "ellipse"
msgstr "椭圆"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:17
msgid "Click on the initial controlling point from the ellipse."
msgstr "从椭圆点点击初始控制点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:18
msgid "Click on the end controlling point from the ellipse."
msgstr "从椭圆点点击终端控制点。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:25
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Add**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > Add** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:28
msgid "Ellipse properties"
msgstr "椭圆属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:30
msgid ""
"The border line and the internal area from the ellipse can be customized at "
"QElectroTech."
msgstr "从椭圆形的边界线和内部区域可以在QEelectroTech定制。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:32
msgid "The border line from a ellipse has the same properties as a `line`_."
msgstr "来自椭圆的边线具有与 `线条 <line_>`_ 相同的属性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:33
msgid ""
"The type of filling for closed primitive objects (rectangle, ellipse and "
"closed polygon) are: **None**, **Solid line** and some types of grids."
msgstr "闭合原始物体(矩形，椭圆形和闭合多边形)的填充类型为：**None**,**Solid line** 和一些类型的网格。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Color selection PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 颜色选择 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:40
msgid "The possible filling colors are defined by the `RGB scale range`_."
msgstr "可能的填充颜色由 `RGB比例范围 <RGB scale range_>`_ 定义。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:44
msgid ""
"The position from the ellipse can be locked to prevent involuntary movement."
msgstr "从椭圆形的位置可以被锁上以防止非自愿移动。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:46
msgid "Go to ellipse properties and check the **Lock position** button."
msgstr "转到椭圆属性并检查 **Lock 位置** 按钮 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:48
msgid ""
"The ellipse properties can be displayed from `menu bar`_, by right click on "
"border from the ellipse, from selection properties panel and using keyboard "
"shortcut."
msgstr "椭圆属性可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 显示，从椭圆右键点击边框，从选择属性面板和使用键盘快捷键。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:52
msgid "Ellipse properties from menu bar"
msgstr "菜单栏的椭圆属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:54
#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:92
msgid "Select the border from the ellipse which should be edited."
msgstr "从应编辑的椭圆中选择边框。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:55
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit the selected object** menu item to display the ellipse "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 编辑选定的对象** 菜单项以显示椭圆属性 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:60
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:63
msgid "Ellipse properties by right click"
msgstr "通过右键单击椭圆属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:65
msgid "Right click on the border from the ellipse which should be edited."
msgstr "右键单击应当编辑的椭圆边框。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:66
msgid ""
"Select the option **Edit the selected object** to display the ellipse "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "选择选项 **编辑选定对象** 以显示椭圆属性 PopUP 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:71
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech ellipse selection PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 椭圆选择 PopUP 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:74
msgid "Ellipse properties from selection properties panel"
msgstr "选择属性面板的椭圆属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:76
msgid ""
"Select one the border from the ellipse which should be edited and the "
"properties from the ellipse will appear at `selection properties panel`_."
msgstr "在 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_ 上选择一个应当编辑的椭圆边框，并显示椭圆的属性。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:81
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech ellipse properties panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 椭圆属性面板"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:85
msgid ""
"If the `selection properties panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed "
"from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**"
msgstr ""
"如果不显示 `选择属性面板 <selection properties panel_>`_，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** 显示"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:88
msgid "Ellipse properties using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键椭圆属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:90
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:93
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the ellipse properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示椭圆属性 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/basics/ellipse.rst:97
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
